WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:46.910
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:47.180 --> 00:50.571
Throughout film history, behind every great filmmaker...

3
00:50.571 --> 00:54.731
[Lost Time] There was a great muse who inspired them.

4
00:54.731 --> 00:55.595
[Director Yang Bursts Onto the Scene]

5
00:55.595 --> 00:57.561
[Director Yang Jun Mo Wins Best Director]

6
00:58.376 --> 01:01.247
But here's the irony.

7
01:01.247 --> 01:03.264
When that muse leaves,

8
01:03.264 --> 01:06.357
what becomes of the creator left behind?

9
01:07.844 --> 01:11.201
Of course, every case is different.

10
01:13.757 --> 01:17.594
Some are branded as masters in name only,

11
01:17.594 --> 01:21.154
unable to prove anything on their own.

12
01:22.635 --> 01:24.566
Today on Cool Guy's Take,

13
01:24.566 --> 01:27.269
we're joined by film critic Hong Jae Hui

14
01:27.269 --> 01:30.995
to talk about great filmmakers and their muses.

15
01:37.202 --> 01:38.748
[Episode 9]

16
01:39.957 --> 01:43.063
- Looking forward to it. - Likewise.

17
01:44.067 --> 01:45.720
- Shall we? - Let's go.

18
01:47.287 --> 01:48.984
How'd the interview go?

19
01:48.984 --> 01:50.404
Good.

20
01:53.037 --> 01:55.935
You looking for something?

21
01:55.935 --> 01:56.979
Where's Yoon Ha Na?

22
01:56.979 --> 01:58.301
What?

23
02:00.150 --> 02:04.539
I saw her heading that way with Ha Ru earlier.

24
02:04.539 --> 02:05.924
Okay.

25
02:15.435 --> 02:20.095
So Eun Soo is you, and Yeong Hyeon is Woo Jae.

26
02:20.845 --> 02:22.725
So...

27
02:22.725 --> 02:26.891
They keep traveling through time with the camcorder...

28
02:26.891 --> 02:28.768
to save the male lead.

29
02:28.768 --> 02:32.900
Everything that happened to Woo Jae and me is in here.

30
02:33.676 --> 02:35.956
Like someone was watching us the whole time.

31
02:37.921 --> 02:39.700
But from here...

32
02:40.381 --> 02:44.452
This is after we came back to the future, right?

33
02:44.452 --> 02:46.022
Yeah.

34
02:46.022 --> 02:49.922
The us we don't remember.

35
02:51.601 --> 02:54.731
Even the part where Woo Jae and I broke up...

36
02:54.731 --> 02:56.457
It's all in here.

37
03:16.523 --> 03:18.367
I'm doing that movie.

38
03:18.367 --> 03:20.147
Don't try to stop me.

39
03:22.658 --> 03:25.498
This is a huge opportunity for me.

40
03:26.478 --> 03:29.402
Eun Soo, you'll get other chances.

41
03:29.402 --> 03:30.639
It doesn't have to be this...

42
03:30.639 --> 03:33.318
Why are you so against it?

43
03:33.318 --> 03:35.562
Everyone else is happy for me. Why are you...

44
03:35.562 --> 03:37.448
Director Cha Seo Yeon.

45
03:40.005 --> 03:43.024
I don't like you being around him.

46
03:43.024 --> 03:44.310
This again?

47
03:44.310 --> 03:46.354
The only reason he's being nice to you

48
03:46.354 --> 03:48.638
is because he wants something.

49
03:48.638 --> 03:50.244
Hey, Choi Yeong Hyeon.

50
03:50.244 --> 03:52.395
You can dislike someone.

51
03:52.395 --> 03:54.906
You don't even need a reason.

52
03:54.906 --> 03:59.661
But you, of all people, shouldn't treat him like that.

53
03:59.661 --> 04:00.564
What?

54
04:00.564 --> 04:02.602
Honestly, you owe where you are now

55
04:02.602 --> 04:05.140
to that short film you made with him.

56
04:05.140 --> 04:08.517
And you'd accuse him on a hunch?

57
04:10.984 --> 04:13.441
I'm not saying this for no reason...

58
04:13.441 --> 04:16.506
I've known him longer than you have. I know him better.

59
04:17.172 --> 04:19.472
He's not like that.

60
04:19.472 --> 04:21.556
And more than anything...

61
04:21.556 --> 04:25.549
he's the only one who believes in me right now.

62
04:25.549 --> 04:28.156
I know you don't like him.

63
04:28.156 --> 04:31.863
But I'm doing this movie.

64
04:31.863 --> 04:35.509
I really want to make it work.

65
04:38.023 --> 04:43.311
Nothing I say gets through to you.

66
04:43.311 --> 04:44.397
Yeong Hyeon.

67
04:44.397 --> 04:46.569
If you're going to do his movie...

68
04:48.622 --> 04:50.627
then break up with me first.

69
04:52.416 --> 04:53.856
What?

70
05:29.396 --> 05:32.104
Do you think Woo Jae and I really...

71
05:32.104 --> 05:34.347
broke up like this?

72
05:35.704 --> 05:39.424
He begged me not to do it...

73
05:39.424 --> 05:42.771
and I just ignored him?

74
05:42.771 --> 05:45.037
We don't know that yet.

75
05:45.037 --> 05:48.077
This could just be a story that Chu Si Hwan made up.

76
05:51.654 --> 05:53.279
And whoever wrote this...

77
05:53.279 --> 05:56.404
how does he know everything you two said in private?

78
05:56.404 --> 05:58.507
Was he bugging you or something?

79
05:58.507 --> 06:00.768
We need to find this bastard.

80
06:00.768 --> 06:05.230
Let's figure out who he is, then go back to 2017.

81
06:05.230 --> 06:09.384
I won't let Woo Jae get hurt again.

82
06:09.384 --> 06:11.857
I'll protect him this time.

83
06:11.857 --> 06:14.203
- Yeah. - Protect who?

84
06:20.555 --> 06:22.687
[Lost Time]

85
06:34.731 --> 06:36.677
Record it...

86
06:43.114 --> 06:45.020
Then it gets saved...

87
06:46.960 --> 06:49.660
And if I travel to the time it was saved...

88
06:53.518 --> 06:55.090
How?

89
07:00.317 --> 07:01.647
What are you doing?

90
07:01.647 --> 07:02.988
If I do this...

91
07:02.988 --> 07:04.574
I should go back to the time I came from...

92
07:04.574 --> 07:07.360
Hey, what the hell are you doing?

93
07:18.173 --> 07:19.324
Cut.

94
07:19.324 --> 07:20.379
What?

95
07:20.379 --> 07:21.865
I said cut.

96
07:23.046 --> 07:27.651
I never gave you any lines, so keep your mouth shut.

97
07:29.846 --> 07:31.395
Drive.

98
07:31.395 --> 07:34.377
There's no scene where you die in a car crash today.

99
07:43.324 --> 07:46.189
Did you read the whole script?

100
07:47.923 --> 07:49.754
Oh, yeah.

101
07:49.754 --> 07:51.280
I did.

102
07:52.196 --> 07:55.094
Take out the time-travel fantasy and change the year...

103
07:55.094 --> 07:59.020
and it's basically our story.

104
08:01.130 --> 08:02.693
Yeah.

105
08:02.693 --> 08:04.714
Darn it.

106
08:04.714 --> 08:06.347
I can't slip up...

107
08:06.347 --> 08:07.625
Exactly.

108
08:07.625 --> 08:10.604
A camcorder that travels through time?

109
08:10.604 --> 08:11.728
It's not a time machine.

110
08:11.728 --> 08:14.044
That's ridiculous, right?

111
08:14.044 --> 08:16.710
That's all you have to say?

112
08:19.401 --> 08:20.767
No, I mean...

113
08:20.767 --> 08:23.424
I was shocked too because it's our story.

114
08:23.424 --> 08:25.124
Whoever the bastard...

115
08:26.237 --> 08:28.322
I mean, whoever the director is...

116
08:28.322 --> 08:30.207
how would they even know about us?

117
08:30.814 --> 08:32.242
Right?

118
08:33.467 --> 08:36.787
You don't know who the director is?

119
08:39.690 --> 08:41.162
Don't tell me...

120
08:42.117 --> 08:43.917
It's Lee Hyeong Won, right?

121
08:44.737 --> 08:46.323
What?

122
08:46.323 --> 08:47.784
Why?

123
08:47.784 --> 08:50.836
It's not him?

124
08:53.116 --> 08:54.681
What are you doing? Let go!

125
08:54.681 --> 08:56.864
We'll check the school's CCTV.

126
08:56.864 --> 08:58.889
You may not believe me, but you'll believe that.

127
08:58.889 --> 09:00.374
Let go of me first.

128
09:00.374 --> 09:03.373
You know how worried you made me?

129
09:05.375 --> 09:06.834
Sorry?

130
09:06.834 --> 09:08.607
Look at me too.

131
09:09.809 --> 09:11.738
Not just Jung Woo Jae.

132
09:16.030 --> 09:17.956
Lee Hyeong Won!

133
09:24.012 --> 09:25.335
I like you.

134
09:25.335 --> 09:30.279
I like you, Jung Woo Jae.

135
09:51.896 --> 09:53.479
Come with me.

136
11:05.413 --> 11:07.969
You're friends with Hyeong Won?

137
11:07.969 --> 11:09.114
Are you two close?

138
11:09.114 --> 11:11.614
How much do you trust that guy?

139
11:11.614 --> 11:13.057
What are you doing right now?

140
11:13.057 --> 11:15.450
You know he disappeared, right?

141
11:15.450 --> 11:18.603
That's suspicious. He has no reason to disappear.

142
11:22.242 --> 11:23.857
"I've always...

143
11:24.539 --> 11:27.480
wanted a new white outfit."

144
11:29.688 --> 11:31.546
Why is this so long?

145
11:34.299 --> 11:37.179
Why is this so complicated?

146
11:40.113 --> 11:43.063
[Lee Hyeong Won's Autobiography] [I've always wanted a new white outfit]

147
11:53.037 --> 11:55.185
I wrote plenty...

148
11:58.925 --> 12:00.403
All right.

149
12:00.403 --> 12:02.615
Maybe I should take a break.

150
12:02.615 --> 12:05.223
An autobiography...

151
12:05.223 --> 12:08.494
Right. Once you win gold, publishers start calling like crazy.

152
12:08.494 --> 12:10.900
I never thought of that.

153
12:11.919 --> 12:14.568
But why would he go into hiding?

154
12:14.568 --> 12:17.695
If you're just playing dumb to avoid me,

155
12:17.695 --> 12:19.237
then let's stop.

156
12:21.096 --> 12:22.443
But...

157
12:30.397 --> 12:33.627
What if it isn't Hyeong Won... then who's Chu Si Hwan?

158
12:34.310 --> 12:36.748
If you'd ever actually listened to me...

159
12:36.748 --> 12:39.155
you wouldn't be saying Chu Si Hwan is Hyeong Won.

160
12:39.155 --> 12:41.676
So who is it?

161
12:49.618 --> 12:52.572
Ha Ru... please don't mess this up.

162
12:52.572 --> 12:54.552
- Just a moment. - Yeah.

163
12:56.333 --> 12:57.853
Yoon Ha Ru!

164
12:58.633 --> 12:59.874
Where've you been?

165
12:59.874 --> 13:01.914
Oh, unnie.

166
13:02.910 --> 13:04.472
"Unnie?"

167
13:04.472 --> 13:07.257
You're impossible to read.

168
13:07.257 --> 13:08.741
Where's Ha Na?

169
13:09.604 --> 13:11.237
Ha Na?

170
13:12.444 --> 13:16.431
She's over there talking to Woo Jae.

171
13:16.431 --> 13:18.343
Just the two of them?

172
13:18.343 --> 13:19.702
How's it going?

173
13:19.702 --> 13:20.937
Are they okay?

174
13:20.937 --> 13:23.033
Hope they work things out.

175
13:23.033 --> 13:24.799
No idea.

176
13:28.993 --> 13:30.197
Babe.

177
13:30.197 --> 13:32.048
Don't you think...

178
13:32.048 --> 13:35.727
we should work on us too?

179
13:36.824 --> 13:39.668
Oh, yeah.

180
13:39.668 --> 13:43.503
About us...

181
13:43.503 --> 13:45.100
Hey! Guys!

182
13:45.100 --> 13:47.340
They're here.

183
13:54.356 --> 13:57.389
Did the talk go okay?

184
13:58.454 --> 14:00.493
Yeah, I guess.

185
14:02.046 --> 14:04.363
Woo Jae really came through for us.

186
14:04.363 --> 14:06.174
I'm proud of him.

187
14:06.174 --> 14:08.857
Thank you, Woo Jae.

188
14:08.857 --> 14:11.290
Thanks, Woo Jae.

189
14:11.290 --> 14:13.208
It's about Ha Ru.

190
14:13.208 --> 14:15.226
I'll do whatever I can to help.

191
14:15.226 --> 14:17.608
You're the best.

192
14:20.575 --> 14:22.064
Seok Min?

193
14:22.064 --> 14:23.190
Yes.

194
14:24.591 --> 14:28.124
- Yes, CEO Seo. - Where's Director Chu now?

195
14:28.124 --> 14:29.617
One second.

196
14:31.237 --> 14:35.925
Oh, Director Chu Si Hwan happens to be in Haesol too.

197
14:35.925 --> 14:38.078
I set up a meeting for today.

198
14:38.928 --> 14:40.852
Just come up a little farther...

199
14:40.852 --> 14:42.863
Can you see me?

200
14:42.863 --> 14:44.541
Over here!

201
14:44.541 --> 14:45.859
Hello.

202
14:45.859 --> 14:47.472
This way, please.

203
14:50.146 --> 14:52.342
He's here.

204
15:02.393 --> 15:06.690
Director Chu Si Hwan is... you?

205
15:07.350 --> 15:09.749
It's been a while, everyone.

206
15:13.251 --> 15:14.931
Woo Jae.

207
15:16.724 --> 15:18.346
Ha Na.

208
15:20.578 --> 15:22.773
I missed you a lot.

209
15:26.773 --> 15:31.149
What? You could've told me.

210
15:31.952 --> 15:36.831
I never would've guessed Chu Si Hwan was your pen name.

211
15:37.833 --> 15:40.852
I didn't want to burden you when you're already so busy.

212
15:40.852 --> 15:44.487
And I wanted the script to stand on its own.

213
15:44.487 --> 15:45.817
CEO Seo.

214
15:45.817 --> 15:48.088
You seriously...

215
15:50.472 --> 15:53.136
"Lost time..."

216
15:53.976 --> 15:57.134
Time-slip stories are everywhere.

217
15:57.134 --> 16:02.509
But our development team is really excited about yours.

218
16:02.509 --> 16:06.398
It's a fantasy, but the characters feel so real.

219
16:06.398 --> 16:08.026
They said it's incredibly immersive.

220
16:08.026 --> 16:09.459
Really?

221
16:11.386 --> 16:13.096
I just want...

222
16:13.096 --> 16:15.817
the characters in my films to feel like they're truly alive.

223
16:15.817 --> 16:17.914
Beyond the words on the page...

224
16:17.914 --> 16:20.814
actually living and breathing.

225
16:23.184 --> 16:25.635
That's why I study real people

226
16:25.635 --> 16:29.320
and do a lot of research.

227
16:31.086 --> 16:33.379
What's he smiling at?

228
16:34.155 --> 16:35.503
I knew.

229
16:35.503 --> 16:38.889
You haven't changed a bit.

230
16:38.889 --> 16:40.271
Hey.

231
16:40.271 --> 16:42.822
Do you know how worried I was?

232
16:42.822 --> 16:45.902
You changed your number, then disappeared on us...

233
16:45.902 --> 16:47.245
Sorry.

234
16:47.863 --> 16:49.586
The camcorder...

235
16:52.771 --> 16:55.830
How did you come up with the camcorder?

236
16:55.830 --> 16:57.792
I thought it was interesting.

237
17:00.800 --> 17:02.833
Oh, that...

238
17:03.433 --> 17:07.443
I figured you'd ask, so I brought it to show you.

239
17:15.259 --> 17:16.413
Is this it?

240
17:16.413 --> 17:19.837
The key that unlocked your creative block?

241
17:19.837 --> 17:21.696
Yeah.

242
17:21.696 --> 17:26.082
I got it by chance during a slump a few years ago.

243
17:26.082 --> 17:27.534
It made me wonder...

244
17:27.534 --> 17:31.118
what if I could go back into old videos?

245
17:31.118 --> 17:32.865
But...

246
17:32.865 --> 17:37.120
for the lead to really need to go back...

247
17:38.160 --> 17:43.226
I figured someone had to die.

248
17:43.961 --> 17:46.418
Someone they love.

249
17:46.418 --> 17:50.257
Someone they'd give their life for.

250
17:50.257 --> 17:54.447
Then they'd do anything to find a way back.

251
17:54.447 --> 17:56.017
Don't you think?

252
18:05.816 --> 18:06.972
Yoon Ha Na.

253
18:06.972 --> 18:08.885
I think this thing's broken.

254
18:08.885 --> 18:10.745
Hey, why did you...

255
18:19.697 --> 18:20.831
Hey.

256
18:20.831 --> 18:22.378
You okay?

257
18:23.318 --> 18:25.199
What's wrong?

258
18:32.383 --> 18:33.937
I'm so scared.

259
18:33.937 --> 18:37.417
What if we suddenly get thrown into another future again?

260
18:38.081 --> 18:41.491
What if I can't see Woo Jae again?

261
18:41.491 --> 18:42.669
No.

262
18:42.669 --> 18:45.440
As long as we don't drop it, it should be okay.

263
18:45.440 --> 18:48.984
We know for sure how to get back to the past where he is.

264
18:48.984 --> 18:52.354
"The past where he is?"

265
19:00.870 --> 19:05.291
Anyway, Jun Mo still has it.

266
19:07.021 --> 19:09.338
What did you two think?

267
19:09.338 --> 19:13.894
He really wants you two for the roles.

268
19:17.429 --> 19:20.339
- Maybe we should pass... - Interesting.

269
19:22.369 --> 19:23.932
Really?

270
19:23.932 --> 19:26.116
- You liked it? - Yeah.

271
19:26.116 --> 19:28.227
I've always liked your scripts.

272
19:28.227 --> 19:31.333
And you gave me this huge comeback project...

273
19:31.333 --> 19:35.199
You're still the only one who looks out for me.

274
19:35.199 --> 19:37.094
What the hell is he doing?

275
19:37.094 --> 19:38.991
So, Ha Na,

276
19:38.991 --> 19:40.334
you're in?

277
19:40.334 --> 19:41.463
Of course.

278
19:41.463 --> 19:43.135
I'd be honored to be in your film.

279
19:43.135 --> 19:44.712
Hey, Yoon Ha Ru...

280
19:45.534 --> 19:47.381
Yoon Ha Na!

281
19:48.753 --> 19:52.002
When are you thinking of shooting?

282
19:53.286 --> 19:58.606
We need to lock the cast first before we set the schedule.

283
20:02.769 --> 20:04.315
Well...

284
20:04.934 --> 20:07.083
I'm afraid I can't do it.

285
20:09.651 --> 20:13.023
Why? You didn't like it?

286
20:13.023 --> 20:16.849
It gave me chills, sir.

287
20:19.515 --> 20:21.708
- "Chills?" - Yes.

288
20:22.534 --> 20:25.667
Like someone stole a diary and made it a script.

289
20:26.273 --> 20:28.636
And Eun Soo, the female lead...

290
20:29.233 --> 20:34.871
She acts like he's the love of her life,

291
20:34.871 --> 20:40.058
then dumps him for her own success.

292
20:40.762 --> 20:43.078
That's pretty realistic too.

293
20:43.078 --> 20:44.092
Well...

294
20:44.092 --> 20:47.325
If that's what you call hyperrealism, I respect it.

295
20:47.325 --> 20:49.551
It's just not for me.

296
20:51.901 --> 20:53.352
Sorry.

297
20:53.352 --> 20:55.066
I'll get going.

298
21:05.656 --> 21:07.372
Sorry.

299
21:07.372 --> 21:10.138
Woo Jae's been a little on edge lately...

300
21:11.910 --> 21:13.030
Jun Mo.

301
21:13.030 --> 21:14.757
Let's have dinner.

302
21:14.757 --> 21:16.889
Today's just pre-shooting, so we'll be done in no time.

303
21:16.889 --> 21:18.879
Let's catch up. It's been a while.

304
21:21.890 --> 21:23.854
- Shall we? - Yeah.

305
21:23.854 --> 21:25.711
Dinner's on me.

306
21:25.711 --> 21:27.211
Great.

307
21:34.992 --> 21:36.985
Hey, Woo Jae.

308
21:40.753 --> 21:43.171
Can we talk for a second?

309
21:43.171 --> 21:46.215
If it's not urgent, let's talk after the shoot.

310
21:46.215 --> 21:48.109
I'm going to take a break.

311
21:51.126 --> 21:53.873
Just give him some time.

312
21:58.297 --> 22:01.690
[Yoon's Raw Fish Restaurant]

313
22:01.690 --> 22:04.760
It's so nice to drink together again.

314
22:04.760 --> 22:05.760
Right?

315
22:05.760 --> 22:08.469
I'm really glad to see you again, Jun Mo.

316
22:08.469 --> 22:10.349
Me too.

317
22:18.553 --> 22:20.332
I'm going to get some air.

318
22:20.332 --> 22:21.582
Want me to come with you?

319
22:21.582 --> 22:22.849
I'm good.

320
22:29.085 --> 22:30.830
Hey, back then...

321
22:30.830 --> 22:33.069
You know...

322
22:33.897 --> 22:36.827
after all the hell you went through on "Silence of Paradise..."

323
22:36.827 --> 22:38.410
You remember?

324
22:40.104 --> 22:42.284
Yeah, right.

325
22:42.923 --> 22:46.075
I was so clueless back then.

326
22:46.075 --> 22:49.040
Still, those bastards...

327
22:49.040 --> 22:51.924
Once the investors came in, it was, "Bring in an established director."

328
22:51.924 --> 22:54.241
"Replace Ha Na with Ha Hyun Ji."

329
22:54.241 --> 22:56.172
One ridiculous demand after another.

330
22:56.172 --> 22:58.072
Darn it.

331
22:58.072 --> 22:59.350
But...

332
22:59.350 --> 23:03.987
Jun Mo, you kept saying, "Yoon Ha Na is the lead!"

333
23:03.987 --> 23:08.139
You went up against the production company and the investors for her.

334
23:09.648 --> 23:11.454
Of course...

335
23:11.454 --> 23:14.411
You lost the rights and walked away with nothing.

336
23:14.411 --> 23:15.783
Forget it.

337
23:15.783 --> 23:18.610
That's all in the past.

338
23:18.610 --> 23:21.396
What matters is what comes next.

339
23:22.790 --> 23:23.954
- Right. - Cheers!

340
23:23.954 --> 23:27.127
- There you are. Let's have a toast! - Cheers!

341
23:27.127 --> 23:30.562
Once you're done here, keep the party going at our place.

342
23:30.562 --> 23:34.506
We've got plenty of snacks, so help yourselves.

343
23:34.506 --> 23:36.126
You stocked the fridge, right?

344
23:36.126 --> 23:38.901
Yeah. Plenty of soju and beer.

345
23:38.901 --> 23:41.954
I'll set out all the bedding,

346
23:41.954 --> 23:45.962
so if you hit your limit, just crash right there.

347
23:45.962 --> 23:50.317
I'll take care of your hangover tomorrow morning too. Okay?

348
23:50.317 --> 23:52.141
- You're the best! - Thank you!

349
23:52.141 --> 23:53.437
Thank you!

350
23:55.114 --> 23:56.232
Babe.

351
23:56.232 --> 23:58.638
Is my face red?

352
23:59.795 --> 24:02.403
No, you look fine.

353
24:04.049 --> 24:06.009
I need the bathroom...

354
24:07.233 --> 24:08.678
CEO Seo.

355
24:08.678 --> 24:10.169
Yeah?

356
24:10.169 --> 24:12.852
I've got something on my mind.

357
24:12.852 --> 24:14.210
Something?

358
24:14.872 --> 24:18.256
I went on a blind date recently.

359
24:18.256 --> 24:21.677
- A blind date? - Why hasn't she... called me?

360
24:21.677 --> 24:23.001
Dad, I...

361
24:23.001 --> 24:26.524
Why hasn't she called me?

362
24:26.524 --> 24:28.342
- Soo Hyuk. - Yeah?

363
24:28.342 --> 24:30.190
What's with your hair?

364
24:30.190 --> 24:31.749
Well...

365
24:59.062 --> 25:01.143
Yoon Ha Ru!

366
25:01.143 --> 25:02.384
Are you out of your mind?

367
25:02.384 --> 25:04.008
You know how Woo Jae and I broke up,

368
25:04.008 --> 25:05.764
and you still said yes to that movie?

369
25:05.764 --> 25:08.917
"You're still the only one who looks out for me?"

370
25:08.917 --> 25:10.624
Did you see Woo Jae's face?

371
25:10.624 --> 25:13.482
Because of you... I hurt him again.

372
25:13.482 --> 25:15.512
- It's okay. - What's okay?

373
25:15.512 --> 25:17.637
Is it enough that you're okay?

374
25:17.637 --> 25:20.504
- Let's go back to 2017. - What?

375
25:20.504 --> 25:24.077
Then none of this would have happened to Woo Jae.

376
25:24.703 --> 25:27.280
The most important thing right now...

377
25:27.280 --> 25:28.772
is Yang Jun Mo.

378
25:28.772 --> 25:30.344
We need to learn more about him.

379
25:30.344 --> 25:33.052
Then we'll know what to prevent.

380
25:33.052 --> 25:34.848
What?

381
25:34.848 --> 25:38.298
You did that on purpose?

382
25:38.298 --> 25:39.749
This is Jun Mo's bag.

383
25:39.749 --> 25:42.002
There has to be something in here.

384
25:42.677 --> 25:44.399
Let's go home.

385
25:49.439 --> 25:51.264
That's why...

386
25:51.264 --> 25:54.773
Women are all like that.

387
25:55.544 --> 25:57.280
Exactly.

388
26:03.433 --> 26:05.439
You know...

389
26:05.439 --> 26:07.483
Since we're talking about relationships...

390
26:07.483 --> 26:08.714
Yeah?

391
26:10.632 --> 26:12.733
It's about a friend of mine.

392
26:14.304 --> 26:20.286
Her boyfriend suddenly stopped wanting any affection.

393
26:21.353 --> 26:26.270
He freaks out whenever she gets close.

394
26:26.270 --> 26:28.194
Why would he do that?

395
26:28.194 --> 26:31.446
He's lost interest. Simple as that.

396
26:31.446 --> 26:33.685
How long have they been together?

397
26:35.424 --> 26:39.591
Eight or nine years, I think.

398
26:39.591 --> 26:42.902
That's plenty of time to get tired of someone.

399
26:42.902 --> 26:45.165
- Or maybe there's another woman. - Hold on.

400
26:45.165 --> 26:48.369
- Right. - Something smells fishy here.

401
26:48.369 --> 26:50.538
She might want to look into him.

402
26:50.538 --> 26:52.287
No, no. Forget that.

403
26:52.287 --> 26:56.655
Why waste time? She should just move on...

404
26:58.496 --> 27:02.202
How can love just change like that?

405
27:05.055 --> 27:06.576
1-2-3-4?

406
27:08.355 --> 27:10.494
That was never going to work.

407
27:10.494 --> 27:12.471
Yang Jun Mo's birthday?

408
27:12.471 --> 27:13.608
October 28.

409
27:13.608 --> 27:15.350
October 28...

410
27:19.283 --> 27:22.571
How are we supposed to guess all these?

411
27:22.571 --> 27:24.503
Anything else?

412
27:48.231 --> 27:49.242
[My Little Canary]

413
27:49.242 --> 27:51.334
What is this?

414
28:00.537 --> 28:02.304
"Canary?"

415
28:15.691 --> 28:17.092
It worked!

416
28:21.050 --> 28:22.315
CEO Seo, here...

417
28:22.315 --> 28:23.485
A tissue...

418
28:23.485 --> 28:25.958
She's drunk.

419
28:27.169 --> 28:28.572
Oh, my...

420
28:28.572 --> 28:30.611
Be careful.

421
28:32.944 --> 28:35.095
Where are Ha Na and Ha Ru?

422
28:35.095 --> 28:37.499
They were looking for their father earlier.

423
28:37.499 --> 28:39.016
- Yeah? - Guys.

424
28:39.016 --> 28:41.036
Try this. It's good.

425
28:41.036 --> 28:42.888
Go on, eat.

426
28:43.704 --> 28:45.711
Thanks.

427
28:51.867 --> 28:53.192
Sir.

428
28:53.192 --> 28:54.912
- Yes, Director Yang? - Well...

429
28:54.912 --> 28:58.018
It's been a while since I drank. It's hitting me fast.

430
28:58.018 --> 29:01.555
I think I'll head in and sleep for about 30 minutes.

431
29:01.555 --> 29:04.162
- You're not trying to ditch us, are you? - Of course not.

432
29:04.162 --> 29:06.794
30 minutes, then you're back for round two. Deal?

433
29:06.794 --> 29:09.763
- Of course. - Oh, right. The gate key...

434
29:11.534 --> 29:12.924
- Thanks. - Follow me.

435
29:12.924 --> 29:14.116
Okay.

436
29:14.116 --> 29:16.933
Jun Mo, just take a quick nap. We've still got round two.

437
29:16.933 --> 29:19.282
- See you later. - See you.

438
29:20.039 --> 29:22.331
- Round two! - Not yet.

439
29:22.331 --> 29:23.927
- Hey, calm down. - Round two...

440
30:10.204 --> 30:11.830
[Canary]

441
30:13.655 --> 30:14.730
[My Little Canary]

442
30:20.142 --> 30:21.764
I finally found it.

443
30:21.764 --> 30:24.131
My little canary.

444
30:25.060 --> 30:27.997
She stole my soul at first sight.

445
30:27.997 --> 30:30.784
We're each other's salvation.

446
30:30.784 --> 30:34.824
What the hell is this?

447
30:34.824 --> 30:37.276
This guy's completely insane.

448
30:37.276 --> 30:42.030
I'm the only sanctuary that can protect her fragile life

449
30:42.030 --> 30:43.685
from this cruel world.

450
30:43.685 --> 30:47.293
You should only breathe inside my cage.

451
30:48.598 --> 30:54.249
My canary dared to leave my cage.

452
30:54.249 --> 30:57.530
Even if I have to stop her from breathing... I'll bring her back.

453
30:57.530 --> 31:02.048
I'll become the only shelter you have...

454
31:02.048 --> 31:05.432
so you'll never leave my cage again.

455
31:06.223 --> 31:09.599
Tonight, I'm reminded of an artist who turned his muse into a stuffed doll,

456
31:09.599 --> 31:13.600
cut off its head, and held a funeral for it.

457
31:16.354 --> 31:18.515
Only your death...

458
31:20.108 --> 31:24.676
can complete the most beautiful, perfect sanctuary I could ever create.

459
32:50.471 --> 32:51.956
Who's that?

460
32:51.956 --> 32:54.536
Mom and Dad wouldn't be home yet.

461
32:55.467 --> 32:56.979
What is this...

462
33:39.741 --> 33:41.694
Ha Na. Are you in there?

463
33:42.361 --> 33:43.531
Yang Jun Mo?

464
33:43.531 --> 33:44.838
What do we do?

465
33:44.838 --> 33:48.022
Want me to knock him out?

466
33:48.757 --> 33:51.271
Let's just get out of here first.

467
33:52.846 --> 33:54.331
You got the camcorder, right?

468
33:57.682 --> 33:59.005
Yeah.

469
34:03.015 --> 34:05.452
Open the door, Ha Na.

470
34:05.452 --> 34:07.174
It's me, Jun Mo.

471
34:36.712 --> 34:37.722
Too obvious.

472
34:37.722 --> 34:39.622
Ha Na!

473
34:39.622 --> 34:41.657
Found the key.

474
34:42.368 --> 34:44.569
I'll open it for you.

475
35:42.494 --> 35:43.988
Now!

476
35:54.836 --> 35:56.240
You saw it.

477
36:03.852 --> 36:05.270
Be careful.

478
37:19.636 --> 37:21.083
No!

479
37:23.753 --> 37:25.140
Hurry!

480
38:15.614 --> 38:17.640
That smell...

481
38:18.848 --> 38:23.776
[October 17, 2017] [Woo Jae's 25th Birthday]

482
38:23.776 --> 38:26.821
The birthday cake I totally ruined for Woo Jae...

483
38:51.452 --> 38:53.295
Did you wait up for me?

484
39:10.919 --> 39:13.409
I'm never...

485
39:13.409 --> 39:16.442
ever letting you go again.

486
39:16.442 --> 39:19.235
What are you talking about?

487
39:25.444 --> 39:26.841
But...

488
39:26.841 --> 39:29.315
what's that smell?

489
39:30.684 --> 39:34.191
Oh, I burned the cake.

490
39:35.694 --> 39:38.345
But it's okay. Ha Ru's bringing one.

491
39:38.345 --> 39:39.746
Probably...

492
39:42.438 --> 39:45.470
Happy birthday, Jung Woo Jae.

493
39:51.941 --> 39:53.593
Thanks.

494
39:54.348 --> 39:56.181
I'm so happy.

495
40:01.840 --> 40:04.004
Hey. Enough already.

496
40:04.004 --> 40:05.928
Can we go inside now?

497
40:05.928 --> 40:07.190
Jeez.

498
40:07.190 --> 40:12.118
Watching my best friend date my twin sister...

499
40:12.118 --> 40:13.152
Come on.

500
40:13.152 --> 40:16.083
This is still Ye Rang Entertainment housing.

501
40:16.083 --> 40:18.420
We've even got a new manager moving in today.

502
40:18.420 --> 40:21.315
Please tone down the PDA a little.

503
40:21.315 --> 40:23.681
Did that scare you?

504
40:23.681 --> 40:25.153
I'm fine!

505
40:25.153 --> 40:26.498
He's the new guy.

506
40:26.498 --> 40:27.625
Hello.

507
40:27.625 --> 40:30.695
I'm Gwak Seong Min. I just joined the team.

508
40:30.695 --> 40:32.169
I'll do my best.

509
40:32.169 --> 40:33.795
Ta-da!

510
40:34.948 --> 40:36.318
Ta-da.

511
40:38.741 --> 40:42.792
♪ Happy birthday to you ♪

512
40:42.792 --> 40:46.228
♪ Happy birthday to you ♪

513
40:46.228 --> 40:49.721
♪ Dear Jung Woo Jae ♪

514
40:49.721 --> 40:53.251
♪ Happy birthday to you ♪

515
40:53.251 --> 40:55.912
- Make a wish! - Make a wish.

516
41:00.925 --> 41:03.007
What did you wish for?

517
41:03.007 --> 41:05.011
- It's a secret. - Yeah?

518
41:05.011 --> 41:07.477
- Can you take a picture for us? - Sure.

519
41:10.413 --> 41:12.297
I'll take it.

520
41:12.297 --> 41:14.783
One, two, three!

521
41:15.464 --> 41:16.747
One more.

522
41:16.747 --> 41:19.188
One, two, three!

523
41:19.188 --> 41:21.425
- Hey. Let's take one together. - Come on.

524
41:21.425 --> 41:23.441
- Let's all take one. - Should I?

525
41:24.388 --> 41:25.605
All right.

526
41:25.605 --> 41:26.638
Everyone, squeeze in.

527
41:26.638 --> 41:28.974
One, two, three!

528
41:32.079 --> 41:33.625
Get over here!

529
41:36.208 --> 41:37.757
Keep it clean!

530
41:42.225 --> 41:43.869
A, B, B!

531
41:43.869 --> 41:45.458
- I'll hit you. - Okay.

532
41:47.478 --> 41:49.035
That hurts!

533
41:49.035 --> 41:51.158
Go easy on me!

534
41:54.676 --> 41:56.536
A, B, A!

535
42:00.460 --> 42:02.459
A, B, B!

536
42:15.766 --> 42:18.060
Should we report that psycho to the police?

537
42:18.060 --> 42:20.783
And tell them what?

538
42:20.783 --> 42:24.132
- What? - That nine years from now, in 2026,

539
42:24.132 --> 42:26.816
Jun Mo's going to come after us with a knife...

540
42:26.816 --> 42:29.529
Report him for attempted murder in the future?

541
42:31.246 --> 42:32.809
Then what about the laptop?

542
42:32.809 --> 42:34.435
He's been writing that stuff since 2012.

543
42:34.435 --> 42:37.939
All that "my little canary" crap.

544
42:37.939 --> 42:39.843
But my name wasn't in it.

545
42:39.843 --> 42:42.909
It's just some symbolic metaphor he wrote for himself.

546
42:45.390 --> 42:48.348
Right now, Jun Mo hasn't done anything.

547
42:48.348 --> 42:51.426
He's just an innocent film student

548
42:51.426 --> 42:55.787
with a twisted imagination who wrote some creepy stuff on his laptop.

549
42:55.787 --> 42:58.587
Then what do we do?

550
43:00.281 --> 43:03.738
I'm not going to be an actress.

551
43:03.738 --> 43:05.354
Sorry?

552
43:05.354 --> 43:06.482
Hey.

553
43:06.482 --> 43:08.439
Are you sure?

554
43:08.439 --> 43:10.276
Yeah.

555
43:10.276 --> 43:12.910
Jun Mo is the one who tried to kill me.

556
43:12.910 --> 43:15.709
And Woo Jae got hurt again trying to save me...

557
43:15.709 --> 43:19.329
I think this is the only way to avoid that fate.

558
43:19.329 --> 43:21.299
I have to quit.

559
43:22.052 --> 43:23.409
But...

560
43:23.409 --> 43:27.496
Can you really live without being an actress?

561
43:27.496 --> 43:29.656
Why couldn't I?

562
43:29.656 --> 43:32.123
You gave up judo too.

563
43:32.123 --> 43:33.869
Because of me.

564
43:33.869 --> 43:35.866
Come on. That's different.

565
43:35.866 --> 43:37.800
I'm fine.

566
43:37.800 --> 43:40.133
In this life...

567
43:40.133 --> 43:43.305
as long as Woo Jae doesn't get hurt because of me.

568
43:44.208 --> 43:45.972
That's all I need.

569
43:55.827 --> 43:57.488
[Senior Yang Jun Mo, Class 50]

570
44:01.946 --> 44:03.458
Hello?

571
44:04.124 --> 44:07.357
Oh, Ha Na. I was actually about to call you.

572
44:07.357 --> 44:09.034
Yeah? Perfect.

573
44:09.034 --> 44:12.623
The revised draft of my new film is ready.

574
44:12.623 --> 44:13.780
Jun Mo,

575
44:13.780 --> 44:15.805
want to meet tomorrow?

576
44:15.805 --> 44:17.530
Sure.

577
44:17.530 --> 44:20.508
Okay. See you there tomorrow.

578
44:24.039 --> 44:25.501
Ha Na.

579
44:28.231 --> 44:29.684
Yes?

580
44:30.973 --> 44:32.596
What are you doing?

581
44:32.596 --> 44:34.286
I have to go now.

582
44:35.903 --> 44:37.840
Yeah. Let's all head out.

583
44:37.840 --> 44:39.524
Let's go.

584
44:39.524 --> 44:40.763
Come on, let's go.

585
44:42.245 --> 44:44.317
[Happy Home]

586
44:47.056 --> 44:48.514
I wish I could stay longer...

587
44:48.514 --> 44:50.228
but I've got an early schedule tomorrow.

588
44:50.228 --> 44:51.445
Don't worry about us.

589
44:51.445 --> 44:53.605
Go get some sleep.

590
44:53.605 --> 44:55.669
Happy birthday, Jung Woo Jae.

591
44:55.669 --> 44:57.196
Thanks.

592
44:57.196 --> 44:58.836
- I'll get going, Ha Na. - Okay.

593
44:58.836 --> 45:00.277
Get home safe.

594
45:09.709 --> 45:11.639
This is my last chance.

595
45:11.639 --> 45:14.763
Woo Jae, you and everything you care about...

596
45:14.763 --> 45:16.776
I'll protect it all.

597
45:16.776 --> 45:20.449
I'll risk everything to keep you safe.

598
45:37.735 --> 45:39.361
Ha Na.

599
45:40.383 --> 45:42.222
Did you wait long?

600
45:42.222 --> 45:44.225
I just got here too.

601
45:53.677 --> 45:55.015
Ta-da!

602
45:55.015 --> 45:58.508
[Silence of Paradise] Silence of Paradise... You remember?

603
45:58.508 --> 46:01.311
Once the investors came in, it was, "Bring in an established director."

604
46:01.311 --> 46:03.260
"Replace Ha Na with Ha Hyun Ji."

605
46:03.260 --> 46:04.961
One ridiculous demand after another.

606
46:04.961 --> 46:06.238
But...

607
46:06.238 --> 46:10.749
Jun Mo, you kept saying, "Yoon Ha Na is the lead!"

608
46:10.749 --> 46:14.381
You went up against the production company and the investors for her.

609
46:14.381 --> 46:15.832
Of course...

610
46:15.832 --> 46:20.204
You lost the rights and walked away with nothing.

611
46:22.463 --> 46:25.261
It's still a graduation film,

612
46:25.261 --> 46:28.440
but the producer sent it around to a few agencies.

613
46:28.440 --> 46:29.904
You know Ha Hyun Ji, right?

614
46:29.904 --> 46:32.634
She went to Cannes last year with "Gyeongseong Lady."

615
46:32.634 --> 46:34.148
Yeah. I know.

616
46:34.148 --> 46:35.692
Her agency wanted a meeting.

617
46:35.692 --> 46:37.036
I turned them down.

618
46:37.036 --> 46:41.127
This film has to be you.

619
46:41.954 --> 46:44.834
Our seniors made Cannes with graduation films.

620
46:44.834 --> 46:47.952
The producers already have big plans for my script.

621
46:47.952 --> 46:50.789
They're even talking about a full theatrical release.

622
46:50.789 --> 46:52.062
Cannes?

623
46:52.062 --> 46:54.353
I think it's your turn, Ha Na.

624
46:57.171 --> 46:59.303
- Jun Mo... - Yes?

625
47:00.591 --> 47:02.432
I can't do this.

626
47:03.624 --> 47:04.946
I'm sorry.

627
47:06.683 --> 47:08.004
What?

628
47:10.584 --> 47:12.281
What are you talking about?

629
47:12.281 --> 47:15.657
- At least read it first... - I...

630
47:15.657 --> 47:17.777
I'm quitting acting.

631
47:18.731 --> 47:19.767
What?

632
47:19.767 --> 47:23.311
I'm done being an actress.

633
47:23.311 --> 47:24.941
I'll find something else.

634
47:24.941 --> 47:26.220
Why?

635
47:28.982 --> 47:31.286
Hey, Ha Na.

636
47:31.286 --> 47:32.583
You're still a rookie.

637
47:32.583 --> 47:34.322
Why give up already?

638
47:34.322 --> 47:36.223
I'm not giving up.

639
47:36.223 --> 47:38.563
I just don't want to do it anymore.

640
47:39.592 --> 47:41.295
Jun Mo.

641
47:41.295 --> 47:44.395
This is a huge opportunity for you.

642
47:44.395 --> 47:47.310
So hold on to Ha Hyun Ji.

643
47:48.056 --> 47:51.246
I respect how strongly you believe in your work.

644
47:51.246 --> 47:52.772
But...

645
47:52.772 --> 47:54.516
you're a professional now.

646
47:54.516 --> 47:56.857
Maybe it's okay to compromise sometimes.

647
47:56.857 --> 48:03.503
I just don't want you to lose your film.

648
48:11.314 --> 48:12.734
I see.

649
48:16.586 --> 48:18.223
Well, then...

650
48:18.223 --> 48:20.047
It can't be helped.

651
48:21.606 --> 48:23.389
I'm sorry, Jun Mo.

652
48:32.393 --> 48:33.756
Ha Na.

653
48:36.093 --> 48:39.126
Could you do me one favor?

654
48:41.693 --> 48:43.316
- Good work! - Good work!

655
48:43.316 --> 48:45.217
Are you heading home?

656
48:45.998 --> 48:48.368
Drop me off at the shared house.

657
48:48.368 --> 48:49.898
What?

658
48:49.898 --> 48:51.454
You saw her yesterday.

659
48:51.454 --> 48:53.179
Miss her that much?

660
48:53.179 --> 48:55.297
Like her that much?

661
48:55.915 --> 48:58.134
I'll get you there safely.

662
48:58.815 --> 49:00.492
You know what Professor Min is like.

663
49:00.492 --> 49:02.707
She's as commercial as they come.

664
49:02.707 --> 49:07.293
She's probably dying to tear my script apart.

665
49:07.293 --> 49:10.046
I can't handle her alone.

666
49:10.840 --> 49:12.338
Okay...

667
49:15.110 --> 49:16.581
Darn it.

668
49:16.581 --> 49:19.557
Where are they going all of a sudden?

669
49:29.194 --> 49:32.384
By the way, Ha Na.

670
49:32.384 --> 49:33.431
Yeah?

671
49:33.431 --> 49:34.696
Until last week...

672
49:34.696 --> 49:36.768
No, even two days ago...

673
49:36.768 --> 49:38.875
you said you'd do it.

674
49:38.875 --> 49:41.075
You said you were grateful.

675
49:42.462 --> 49:43.629
Yeah.

676
49:43.629 --> 49:44.849
I did.

677
49:44.849 --> 49:47.542
And now, you're quitting acting?

678
50:14.890 --> 50:16.194
Jun Mo.

679
50:16.194 --> 50:17.371
Slow down.

680
50:17.371 --> 50:18.945
I'm scared...

681
50:19.578 --> 50:21.427
What's there to be scared of?

682
50:21.427 --> 50:23.656
I feel like we're going to crash.

683
51:20.927 --> 51:23.589
That psycho...

684
51:24.819 --> 51:27.797
Please. What's gotten into you?

685
51:33.365 --> 51:34.774
Ha Na.

686
51:40.954 --> 51:43.458
She didn't say she was going anywhere...

687
51:43.458 --> 51:44.940
Where did she go?

688
51:51.484 --> 51:52.484
[Naa]

689
52:09.568 --> 52:11.271
I'm just going to the bathroom.

690
52:40.746 --> 52:42.886
What are you looking for?

691
52:45.666 --> 52:47.191
I...

692
52:47.191 --> 52:49.636
I think I lost my phone.

693
52:49.636 --> 52:51.414
That's too bad.

694
52:51.414 --> 52:52.646
But Ha Na.

695
52:52.646 --> 52:54.242
Yeah?

696
52:54.242 --> 52:55.591
Why...

697
52:58.076 --> 53:00.371
Why are you quitting acting?

698
53:01.863 --> 53:03.406
Why?

699
53:03.406 --> 53:04.687
Huh?

700
53:05.342 --> 53:06.667
Why?

701
53:06.667 --> 53:08.904
Something's changing...

702
53:08.904 --> 53:11.480
I've never seen him like this before.

703
53:12.595 --> 53:14.422
Hey.

704
53:14.422 --> 53:16.045
Why are you looking at me like that?

705
53:16.045 --> 53:17.819
Is it because of me?

706
53:17.819 --> 53:20.095
Because I changed the past?

707
53:20.811 --> 53:23.811
I'm just curious.

708
53:23.811 --> 53:26.361
Why would you quit acting?

709
53:26.361 --> 53:27.893
Why...

710
53:28.527 --> 53:30.059
Jun Mo.

711
53:37.887 --> 53:41.487
The person you are calling is unavailable...

712
53:51.017 --> 53:52.683
[Beast: Answer me]

713
53:56.893 --> 53:58.063
Yoon Ha Na.

714
53:58.063 --> 53:59.470
Check your messages.

715
53:59.470 --> 54:00.787
Why are you in that bastard's car?

716
54:00.787 --> 54:02.347
Where are you going? I lost you.

717
54:02.347 --> 54:03.485
Pick up.

718
54:03.485 --> 54:05.150
Yoon Ha Na!

719
54:05.150 --> 54:06.900
Pick up already.

720
54:06.900 --> 54:09.127
What the hell...

721
54:09.127 --> 54:10.844
is going on?

722
54:10.844 --> 54:12.140
Hang in there.

723
54:12.140 --> 54:14.507
I'm going home right now to smash the camcorder.

724
54:14.507 --> 54:16.199
"The camcorder?"

725
54:23.794 --> 54:25.284
Ha Na.

726
54:25.284 --> 54:26.737
Yeah.

727
54:58.697 --> 55:00.784
What is this?

728
55:03.263 --> 55:06.230
"2026?"

729
55:08.872 --> 55:11.375
- Jun Mo. - Yeah, Ha Na...

730
55:11.375 --> 55:12.734
Why?

731
55:14.672 --> 55:16.011
Why?

732
55:16.627 --> 55:18.140
Why!

733
55:25.324 --> 55:27.430
I'm asking you.

734
55:29.309 --> 55:30.596
Why?

735
55:31.580 --> 55:34.046
In the future you just came back from...

736
55:37.405 --> 55:39.653
Did I kill you or something?

737
56:21.709 --> 56:23.226
It started the same way before.

738
56:23.226 --> 56:27.438
From now on, every trace he leaves is evidence for us.

739
56:27.438 --> 56:29.051
He'll show up again, right?

740
56:29.051 --> 56:30.543
I kept seeing it...

741
56:30.543 --> 56:32.576
That creepy look in his eyes.

742
56:34.116 --> 56:38.133
In the past, they'd give up everything for you.

743
56:38.133 --> 56:41.117
You and I may be in different situations...

744
56:41.117 --> 56:43.520
but we want the same thing.

745
56:43.520 --> 56:46.053
What do you want me to do?

746
56:46.053 --> 56:48.163
Let's get rid of them.

747
56:48.163 --> 56:50.511
I'll protect the past.
